-- TESTS for roc1-order-6.l4 (Order 6, commencement of proceedings).  Every expected value is written from the text beside the assertion.
-- Calendar: 5 Nov 2026 is a Thursday; the fixture holidays 11 and 23 Nov 2026 are not statements that they are holidays.
-- Periods from 5 Nov 2026: 14 days end 19 Nov; 21 days end 26 Nov; 28 days end 3 Dec; 5 weeks end 10 Dec.

`o 6 test calendar` MEANS `Court calendar` WITH
    `public holidays` IS LIST Date 11 11 2026, Date 23 11 2026

-- Rule 1(1): the saving words
#ASSERT `o 6 r 1(1) a claimant may commence proceedings by an originating claim or an originating application` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 6 r 1(1) a claimant may commence proceedings by an originating claim or an originating application` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Rule 1(2): where the material facts are in dispute
